---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  current="legal"
  title="Privacy | ChargeVia by Rangeway"
  description="How ChargeVia by Rangeway handles information shared through this website."
>
  <div class="wrap legal">
    <div class="legal__inner">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="lede">This is an informational website. It does not offer accounts or an email signup form.</p>
      <h2>When you contact us</h2>
      <p class="body">If you email us, we receive your email address and whatever information you choose to include. We use it to read your message, respond, and continue the conversation you started.</p>
      <h2>Website data</h2>
      <p class="body">Like most websites, our hosting provider may process technical request data needed to deliver and protect the site, such as an IP address, browser information, and request time.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p class="body">To ask about information you have sent us, contact <a href="mailto:hello@chargevia.net">hello@chargevia.net</a>.</p>
      <p class="legal__updated">Last updated: July 30, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
